('sling','game',26,'Carry. Dash. Follow.','THE SLING',"This gel curtain grows back. Carrying your friend gets you to the wall, but you still can't get through. So she carries him over the gap. He dashes out of her grip and breaks the gel. She follows before it closes. Watch their timing."),
('parry','game',25,'Return to sender.','A FOUR-STEP HAND-OFF',"This door needs a bell that's out of reach. Pompadour parries a scissor, sending it back horizontally. Twin-Tails catches the blue scissor, then tosses it straight up. The enemy's attack becomes the tool that opens your route. Both players have a job in that chain."),
('salon','game',20,'Wash. Dry. Try again.','THE SALON CHANGES THE RULES',"Get soaked and Twin-Tails can't glide. Pompadour can't break gel. Warm air dries you off and lifts Twin-Tails. Carry your friend into it, and you rise together. You have to choose when to cross the showers, and when to wait."),
